# MaxPain streams-panel-zap.patch — minimal 3.3.78-style Streams + channel zap.
#
# Backend:
#   - Live+session in `panel_streams` (soft-preserve between segment gaps)
#   - Refuse soft-preserve when same client already watches another channel (zap)
#   - Fix double-increment ghost connection counter
#
# Frontend:
#   - Live+session sticky rows; virtual_id-aware `prune_zapped_preserved_streams`
#
# Deliberately omits nuclear zap (terminate_other_channel_*, zap_close on HLS/update_connection)
# which cut live playback mid-watch in v3.3.108–112.
diff --git a/backend/src/api/model/active_user_manager.rs b/backend/src/api/model/active_user_manager.rs
